    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry Fitzgerald Stack are delighted to present this impressive south-facing detached residence extending to approximately 2,000 sq. ft., superbly positioned on the edge of the charming coastal village of Glin within an exclusive and well-established development of just 23 detached homes.\nThis attractive family home enjoys picturesque views over the Shannon Estuary from the rear and is conveniently situated within walking distance of a wide range of village amenities including a shop and filling station, café, primary school, pharmacy, playground, pubs and the historic Glin Castle. \nThe accommodation has been thoughtfully designed to cater for modern family living. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious lounge/sitting room, an open-plan kitchen and dining area, a versatile second reception room suitable as a family room, home office or fifth bedroom, together with a utility room and guest W.C. Upstairs, there are four generous double bedrooms, three of which benefit from ensuite facilities, in addition to a well-appointed family bathroom.\nExternally, the home enjoys a private rear garden with mature lawns, a raised planting area and a patio area, creating an ideal space for outdoor dining and entertaining. French doors from the main living area provide seamless access to the garden. An attached garage with roller door and pedestrian access offers excellent storage and workshop potential, while a separate detached garage extending to approximately 18 sq. m. provides additional storage or hobby space. Further features include gated side access on both sides of the property, an enclosed dog run and clothes canopy.\nCombining generous living accommodation, beautiful estuary views and a convenient village setting, this exceptional property offers the perfect balance of comfort, space and lifestyle, making it an ideal family home.\nViewing is highly recommended and strictly by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - 4.78m x 2.63m\nwith wooden laminate flooring, 2 sidelights and fanlight\n\nLounge / Sitting Room - 5.57m x 3.66m\nsolid fuel stove with granite fireplace, wooden flooring, bay window french doors leading to kitchen/dining room\n\nKitchen / Dining Room - 8.19m x 3.60m\nIvory fitted kitchen, wall & floor tiles, french doors to rear garden\n\nUtility Room - 2.78m x 1.61m\nlarge fitted unit, floor tiles, half glazed door to rear & window\n\nW/C - 1.61m x 1.38m\nwith floor tiles, whb & w/c\n\nLiving Room / 5th Bedroom - 3.43m x\nwooden laminate flooring & window\n\nLanding - 4.98m x 2.69m\nwith carpet flooring, window, access to Stira stairs\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.91m x 3.55m\ndouble with sliderobes, carpet flooring & window\n\nEnsuite - 2.93m x 0.98m\nplumbed for shower, whb & w/c, floor tiles & window\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.57m x 3.27m\ndouble with sliderobes, carpet flooring & window\n\nEnsuite - 2.78m x 0.87m\npumped shower, wall & floor tiles, whb, w/c & window\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.59m x 3.42m\ndouble with fitted units, carpet flooring & window\n\nEnsuite - 2.42m x 0.85m\nTriton T90 SR, wall & floor tiles, whb & w/c\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.43m x 2.63m\ndouble with carpet flooring & window\n\nFamily Bathroom - 2.68m x 2.23m\nbath with pumped shower, wall & floor tiles, whb, w/c & window\n\nGarage - 5.95m x 2.95m\nwith roller door & window\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Spacious detached 45 bedroom, 5-bathroom south-facing residence</li><li>Within walking distance to the scenic village of Glin and all amenities</li><li>5 min drive to the neighboring village of Tarbert</li><li>50 min drive to Limerick via N69 Limerick to Kerry route</li><li>Views of the Shannon Estuary to the rear</li><li>Fibre broadband available for connection</li><li>Mains connections to all essential services</li><li>Energy efficient home</li><li>Attached garage and 18sqm detached garage ideal for storage / DIY purposes</li><li>Double glazed upvc windows fitted throughout</ul>"
      },
